"explanationEnglish": "At simple interest, formula is: (n₁ - 1) / T₁ = (n₂ - 1) / T₂. Here, (2 - 1) / 6 = (4 - 1) / T₂ => 1/6 = 3/T₂ => T₂ = 18 years.",
